{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 21, :comments ["<b>And he saw the Kenite.</b> The family of Jethro, and it is written <i>they are the Kenites</i>. He joined <b>the Kenite</b> to the proverb: <i>set your nest in the rock</i>. The meaning is doubled, for even if your dwelling were as high as a bird's nest, it would not save you."], :book :numbers, :voice :ibn-ezra, :lang :en, :chapter 24, :notes {}, :source-witnesses [["On Your Way" "http://mobile.tora.ws/"]], :timestamp "2026-07-09T19:19:21.217846256Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}